{
  "slug": "foresight-intelligence",
  "name": "Foresight Intelligence",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Strategic foresight intelligence using IFTF methodology. Two prediction modes: Soft Predict Future (Claude-native skill, instant, claude.ai + Claude Code) and Hard Predict Future (deterministic 12-step pipeline, Python-computed — Claude Code only). Both output four independent futures (Probable/Plausible/Possible/Preferable) with per-stakeholder conditional analysis. Try: Will India become the global AI leader? Will OpenAI or Anthropic win?",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `hard-predict-future` (Activate this agent for any future-oriented question that requires deep quantitative analysis, historical precedents, and structured scenario planning), `soft-predict-future` (Activate this skill for ANY future-oriented question).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install foresight-intelligence@claude-community` from `isanthoshgandhi/foresight-engine`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
